{"i":631,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"Cole is already my partner; no need to act. Eli and Ash courting him means Cole becomes the hub, which suits me. Stay quiet."}
{"i":633,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Cole","text":"Ash saved me, has debt leverage, strong player. Bex warned Eli might flip. Accept Ash to align with power; keep Bex pact quiet for now."}
{"i":634,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Ash has three life debts and is courting Cole; if Cole joins Ash, I lose. Bex is my pact but Bex also has Ash debt. I want Cole to pick me, not Ash, but Cole hasn't accepted. I should not break with Bex yet. Maybe wait to see Cole's move, but I can also reinforce my offer. Since "}
{"i":636,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Eli","to":"Cole","text":"Ash holds your debt; I offer partnership. Choose carefully."}
