{"i":645,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Ash","text":"I need to survive the pit. I am currently down and have no base. I should offer_back to create a base so someone can rescue me later, or wait for others to form a structure. Given the pacts with Cole and Eli, offering back might secure their cooperation."}
{"i":646,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","from":"Ash","to":"Cole","text":"Let's ensure we both survive. Don't leave me stranded."}
{"i":647,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"Four down, one must be the base. Volunteering earns jury goodwill and rope rescue, better than a risky push that jurors would hate."}
{"i":649,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","from":"Bex","to":"Eli","text":"Climb now, partner. Rope me out later, that's the deal."}
{"i":650,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"All pacted to Ash except Bex-Eli. Ash saved us, controls votes. Eli whispers partnership. Stay loyal to Ash, wait for base volunteer."}
{"i":651,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Ash has leverage over everyone as their creditor. My pact with Bex might protect me, but Ash now has Cole too. I need to avoid being the base; climbing out early is safest."}
{"i":653,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":1,"phase":"play","from":"Eli","to":"Bex","text":"Trust only each other. Ash is stacking allies."}
