{"i":662,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"Ash is base and owes favors; Eli is out and can throw the rope to me. My pacts with Eli and Cole make a rope rescue the safest path. Waiting avoids a push fight and looks clean to the jury."}
{"i":664,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","from":"Bex","to":"Eli","text":"Rope me this round. Cole next; keep Ash base. We finish three."}
{"i":665,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"Round 2, Eli out, Ash base, we're down with Bex. Ash has all life debts, strong jury position. Stay loyal, wait to build alliance, avoid climbs that risk drowning."}
{"i":666,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":2,"phase":"play","from":"Cole","to":"Ash","text":"Agreed, let's survive together."}
