{"i":683,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"Bex wants me to rope her, but I owe Ash a life debt and Ash is already out. Roping Bex now keeps her safe and maintains our pact. Cole could be next. I'll rope Bex as planned."}
{"i":685,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","from":"Eli","to":"Bex","text":"Roping you now. Cole next."}
