{"i":710,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Cole","text":"Eli is anchor with rope used, we're both down, flood at 4, final round. Climb might let one out if 2 climbers escape. Wait risks drowning but preserves pacts."}
{"i":711,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Eli","text":"I am the anchor; Cole is down with me. Ash and Bex are out. No base exists now, so I cannot reach down; I must wait or break pact. Breaking pact would hurt Bex's vote, but I might need her vote. I'll honor the pact and wait; only one round left, likely safe."}
